    "description": "Generate Capital is an investment and operating platform focused on distributed and sustainable infrastructure assets. Its end markets include clean energy, water, waste, mobility, digital infrastructure, agriculture, and industrial decarbonization customers and partners. The platform uses an asset-heavy model that combines project development, financing, ownership, and operations across thousands of infrastructure assets. Public company materials state that Generate was founded in 2014 and has invested in and operated assets across multiple infrastructure sectors in the United States and other markets. In July 2021, Harbert Infrastructure agreed to acquire an interest in Generate as part of a $2 billion equity raise alongside other institutional investors including AustralianSuper and QIC. Generate continues to operate as a multi-sector sustainable infrastructure platform with institutional backing from those investors and other partners.",
